  "user_request_original": "Design a defect-cavity bandpass filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack: 8 periods of Al2O3/MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) quarter-wave pairs, one Al2O3 cavity layer at center, then 8 periods of MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos)/Al2O3 quarter-wave pairs. Total 17 layers. Optimize all individual layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm while minimizing transmittance in 300-700 nm and 700-1100 nm. No metal layers. Materials: al2o3, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos).",
  "normalized_request_english": "Design a 17-layer dielectric bandpass filter on fused silica with air incidence, consisting of alternating Al2O3 and MgF2 layers with a central Al2O3 defect, optimizing all thicknesses to maximize transmission in 255–280 nm while minimizing it in 300–1100 nm.",
